<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12442" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδέρω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδερμᾰτ-δείρω</span></b>  (also in
			<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>V.</u>
			1286
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flay, skin
				completely,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸρ βοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.40
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.60
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				<i>scalp,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.64
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόβατα ἀποδαρέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.5.9
				</span></i>
			; <i>become excoriated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philum.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.29.61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>flay by flogging, fetch the skin off one's back,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				739
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> sens. obsc.,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				953
			</span></i>; </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Medic.,
				<i>separate by avulsion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.896
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>strip off,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πᾶσαν ἀνθρωπηΐην</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορήν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.25
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
